<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Elbert Cty SD No C-2, Colo..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Elbert Cty SD No C-2, Colo..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it received the written award for $2.3 million of Elbert County School District No. C-2 (Kiowa), Colo., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.60 in 2016.</p>
